  "title": "Fried Chicken Biryani (Filipino-Style)",
  "description": "Basmati rice is layered with fried chicken, vegetables, and plenty of aromatics in this Filipino adaptation of traditional Indian biryani.",
  "authors": [
    "Rieaane"
  ],
